{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：S08、S11、S12等短停留段落，Y的叙述和感受层次仍偏密，快速扫读不如X直接；X的左右分栏更容易一眼找到信息。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用【】把每段叙事的关键转折突出出来，感受又有小字和到时出现的时间控制，能让观众在听音乐时逐步接收信息，而不是一次面对所有提示。它对人物从不服气、怀念亲近、害怕孤独，到接受矛盾并继续生活的心理变化交代得更细，音乐感受也更具体，前后呼应更充分。X的优势是简洁、左右分区明确，但部分音乐变化和心理转折被压缩成概括性短词，细腻度和层次感不及Y。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2697670a-b9fc-4b92-90dc-fbd51766dbc5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061812321746Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:19:21.222040+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07bfe5365abc84973e905580c814a6946550d36f755a34f7c92dfaf0fb54b330", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734b